---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { SITE, DISCLAIMER } from '../config';
---
<Prose
  title="Terms of Service — CabSnap"
  description="Terms governing use of CabSnap."
  path="/terms"
  heading="Terms of Service"
  updated="[DATE]"
>
  <div class="note">
    <strong>Draft — requires legal review before publishing.</strong> A structural
    starting point, not a reviewed legal document.
  </div>

  <h2>Agreement</h2>
  <p>
    By using CabSnap you agree to these terms. CabSnap is operated by
    {SITE.company}, {SITE.companyLocation}.
  </p>

  <h2>What CabSnap is</h2>
  <p>{DISCLAIMER}</p>

  <h2>Your responsibilities</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You are responsible for the accuracy of your own tax records.</li>
    <li>You should verify extracted data against the original receipt. Automated text extraction makes mistakes.</li>
    <li>You must not use the app for unlawful purposes.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your content</h2>
  <p>
    Your receipt images are yours. [CONFIRM: the licence the app requires to store
    and process them, stated in plain language.]
  </p>

  <h2>Payment</h2>
  <p>
    CabSnap is free to download. In-app purchases are processed by Google Play and
    governed by Google's terms. [CONFIRM: subscription duration, renewal behaviour,
    and refund policy.]
  </p>

  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to keep the service running but do not guarantee uninterrupted
    availability. [CONFIRM: limitation of liability — legal review required.]
  </p>

  <h2>Termination</h2>
  <p>You may stop using CabSnap at any time. [CONFIRM: data export and deletion on termination.]</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
</Prose>
